# Plan And Progress Artifact Contract

Use explicit runtime artifacts instead of keeping planning and execution memory only in chat.

## Plan artifact

Marker:

```markdown
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PLAN:START -->
# PLAN::ISSUE-ID
...
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PLAN:END -->
```

Body template:

- `.ai/reference/plan-template.md`

## Progress artifact

Marker:

```markdown
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:START -->
# PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID
...
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:END -->
```

Minimal structure:

```markdown
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:START -->
# PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID

## Выполнено
- [x] Step 1: ...
- [x] Step 2: ...

## Текущий шаг
**Step N: ...**
- [ ] subtask 1
- [ ] subtask 2

## Дальше
- Step N+1: ...

## Не нарушить
- invariant 1
- invariant 2

## Spec Conformance
- Closed:
  - requirement X -> code/tests/evidence
- Open:
  - requirement Y -> planned step
- Drift:
  - `None.` or exact mismatch and corrective action

## Решения по ходу
- YYYY-MM-DD: decision / reason

## Risks / Notes
- ...
<!-- AI_SIMPLE_PROGRESS:END -->
```

## Update protocol

- `/plan` creates or updates `PLAN::ISSUE-ID`.
- `/build` creates or updates `PROGRESS::ISSUE-ID`.
- Progress must be updated at every step transition, not only at the end.
- `Do Not Break` invariants come from the plan, not from improvisation during coding.
